air - ORBBEC - Leading Provider of Robotics and AI Vision","date":null,"quote":"October 15, 2026\nShare\nGUANGZHOU, October 15, 2026\n– Orbbec, a leading provider of robotics and AI vision, today unveiled the Pulsar MH24, a compact, high-performance 24-channel 3D LiDAR designed for reliable robotic perception across indoor and outdoor environments.\nDebuting at the 140th China Import and Export Fair (Canton Fair), the Pulsar MH24 addresses the integration, sensing performance, and reliability requirements of robotic lawnmowers, autonomous mobile robots (AMRs), delivery robots, and other mobile robotic platforms. Orbbec also showcased its depth cameras and RGB cameras, and presented its contract manufacturing (CM) services for complete robots and components.\nPulsar MH24: A Compact 3D LiDAR for Large-Scale Robot Deployment\nAs mobile robots take on more demanding tasks across diverse environments, sensing systems must deliver consistent spatial data while meeting increasingly stringent size, power, and integration requirements. To tackle these challenges, the Pulsar MH24 combines 24-channel 3D sensing with a compact mechanical design, making it well-suited for robot deployment at scale.\nCompact Design, Detailed Point Clouds\nThe Pulsar MH24 measures 66.6 × 62.1 × 66 m"}],"formatted":"2026-10-15"},{"metric":"scan_frequency","label":"Scan frequency","group":"Hardware","value":"5/10Hz","unit":"","conditions":"Configuration: Manufacturer exact-model specifications","claimStage":"unknown","controlMode":"unknown","evidenceKind":"manufacturer","conflict":false,"sources":[{"url":"https://www.orbbec.com.cn/xin/products/pulsar-mh24/","title":"Pulsar MH24_紧凑型高性能多线3D激光雷达_奥比中光官网","date":null,"quote":"方位扫描频率\n5/10Hz"}],"formatted":"5/10Hz"},{"metric":"storage_temperature","label":"Storage temperature","group":"Hardware","value":"-40℃~70℃","unit":"","conditions":"Configuration: Manufacturer exact-model specifications","claimStage":"unknown","controlMode":"unknown","evidenceKind":"